{"4635820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "YO UP!", "steam_appid": 4635820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need teamwork to climb anything at all. Place planks, ladders, bridges and improvised structures to create paths upward, but every addition makes your tower more unstable. Help each other build, or accidentally destroy everything in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/d82d84ba50dbd1acfcdea24bc9b68834.poster.avif?t=1781440081\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/d82d84ba50dbd1acfcdea24bc9b68834.webm?t=1781440081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/d82d84ba50dbd1acfcdea24bc9b68834.mp4?t=1781440081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD &amp; CLIMB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing here is stable. Construct your own way forward using physics-based building and climbing mechanics. Every structure bends, sways, and collapses under pressure. One wrong placement can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/1cb06143de38678fe8fc415e3644ff1d.poster.avif?t=1781440081\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/1cb06143de38678fe8fc415e3644ff1d.webm?t=1781440081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/1cb06143de38678fe8fc415e3644ff1d.mp4?t=1781440081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected. Your creations are only as stable as your last placement. Watch entire towers collapse, recover mid-climb, or turn brilliant plans into disasters in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/9b079679cd137ea50f50749d2a48f2bb.poster.avif?t=1781440081\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/9b079679cd137ea50f50749d2a48f2bb.webm?t=1781440081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/9b079679cd137ea50f50749d2a48f2bb.mp4?t=1781440081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REACH THE SKY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through floating island layers as you climb higher and higher toward space. Each stage pushes your teamwork, creativity, and patience further than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/ea010616b23fd5fefa712321fc328a34.poster.avif?t=1781440081\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/ea010616b23fd5fefa712321fc328a34.webm?t=1781440081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/ea010616b23fd5fefa712321fc328a34.mp4?t=1781440081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLIMBING IS BETTER WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or invite up to three friends in online co-op. Work together to build your way up or struggle to survive each other’s “helpful” construction ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/03d60fa2c84bb9002ebe0b4c0491256f.poster.avif?t=1781440081\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/03d60fa2c84bb9002ebe0b4c0491256f.webm?t=1781440081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635820/extras/03d60fa2c84bb9002ebe0b4c0491256f.mp4?t=1781440081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based building and climbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully emergent chaos-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floating island vertical progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or multiplayer play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly unstable structures</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need teamwork to climb anything at all. Place planks, ladders, bridges and improvised structures to create paths upward, but every addition makes your tower more unstable. Help each other build, or accidentally destroy everything in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared